WEBVTT

00:17:58.476 --> 00:18:01.756
fatty fishes, olive oil, nuts, beans,

00:18:01.756 --> 00:18:06.276
these are the kinds of foods
that really fuel and support heart health,

00:18:06.316 --> 00:18:07.836
brain health and memory.

00:18:08.436 --> 00:18:10.876
And it doesn’t have to be
100 percent, folks, right?

00:18:10.876 --> 00:18:12.756
You're not going to be perfect at this,

00:18:12.756 --> 00:18:14.076
and that's OK.

00:18:14.076 --> 00:18:15.436
Try to do it overall, right?

00:18:15.476 --> 00:18:16.996
Today, what did I eat overall?

00:18:16.996 --> 00:18:19.236
This week, how did I do overall?

00:18:19.276 --> 00:18:22.756
Because I think we need to have
realistic expectations.

00:18:23.116 --> 00:18:25.636
So exercise,

00:18:25.676 --> 00:18:29.796
the diet, sleep and stress
and learning new things.